    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Create Step-by-Step HowTo Guides &#8211; Transform your instructions into clear, organized tutorials, perfect for DIY projects that help your readers accomplish tasks efficiently.<br />\n<a href=\"https://www.oxyplug.com/products/oxyplug-howto/how-to-repot-your-plants/?utm_source=description-tab&amp;utm_medium=wp-repo&amp;utm_campaign=oxyplug-howto-maker\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Oxyplug HowTo Maker Demo</a></p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>Install it, Activate it, Use it 🙂<br />\n<a href=\"https://www.oxyplug.com/docs/oxy-how-to/?utm_source=installation-tab&amp;utm_medium=wp-repo&amp;utm_campaign=oxyplug-howto-maker\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Oxyplug HowTo Maker Installation</a></p>\n<p>1..2..3..Done 🙂</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.2.0</h4>\n<p><em>Remove schema script since Google does not support it anymore</em></p>\n<h4>2.1.4</h4>\n<p><em>Change init hook to plugins_loaded for load_plugin_textdomain</em><br />\n<em>Tested up to 6.7</em></p>\n<h4>2.1.3</h4>\n<p><em>Delete buttons text overflowing fixed</em><br />\n<em>Switch wrong state fixed</em></p>\n<h4>2.1.2</h4>\n<p><em>Undefined $config fixed</em></p>\n<h4>2.1.1</h4>\n<p><em>Differ site language from user language</em></p>\n<h4>2.0.1</h4>\n<p><em>Undefined js variables fixed</em></p>\n<h4>2.0.0</h4>\n<p><em>Premium Features Provided For FREE</em></p>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date &#8211; 29 August 2021</em></p>\n"
    },
